  "author_notes": "Setup kit: supply the listed CUE/BIN disc set and your own SCPH1001 BIOS dump.",
  "notes": "Track 01 digests measured from an owned disc set; serials and track counts from the repo's disc_set.json; launch name from the kit's EXE_NAME; release v0.1.0.",
  "build": {
    "enabled": true,
    "source": {
